## Python3 코드
```python
arr = [ [0, 0, 1],
        [1, 0, 0],
        [0, 1, 0] ]

for k in range(3):
    for i in range(3):
        for j in range(3):
            if arr[i][k] and arr[k][j]:
                arr[i][j] = 1

result = 0
for i in range(3):
    for j in range(3):
        result += arr[i][j]

print(result)
```

## C 코드
